    "Company About Us Overview Innovation Our Locations Careers Investors Capital Corporate Responsibility Overview Sustainability People Supply Chain Ethics Philanthropy Data Privacy News & Events Newsroom Press Releases Events Blog Posts Shopping for business? Join our business program today to get tiered pricing, rewards for your purchases, and more exclusive benefits. See All Benefits Sign Up Now Tiered Pricing for Business Members Get special rates on select products. New products added monthly. p.nav-promo-tiered-pricing { background-image: url(\"https://www.westerndigital.com/content/dam/store/en-us/assets/business/icons/icon-tiered-pricing-53.png\"); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding-left: 67px; padding-top: 5px; min-height: 60px; } See All Products with Tiered Pricing",
    "Count on us to help you transform data, achieving breakthroughs to create a better, safer, and more connected world.",
    "Data growth continues to accelerate with more data generated in the last three years than in the past 3,0001. And yet, approximately only 2% of all data is saved, fueling the need for mass storage solutions that can transform data into insights to improve how we live, work, and connect.",
    "Enter WD, whose HDD technologies have been at the innovation forefront for 50-plus years. Whether it’s driving cutting-edge healthcare, leveraging AI to solve global problems, or capturing user likes and dislikes to generate music recommendations, WD HDD innovations help unlock data’s potential—creating new opportunities, spurring new discoveries, and delivering better experiences.",
    "Learn how our innovations drive digital transformation",
    "50+",
    "Years pioneering data storage innovations",
    "32TB",
    "HDD—the highest achieved, leveraging WD’s most advanced technologies",
    "~3000",
    "Active HDD patents secured by WD’s innovative technologists",
    "180M+",
    "HelioSeal drives have been deployed since its introduction in 20132",
    "WD HDD innovations help turn data into actionable insights and life-changing outcomes.",
    "WD’s High Bandwidth Drive Technology (HBDT) will significantly boost performance without raising total cost of ownership. HBDT enables concurrent access to multiple tracks, so cloud customers can benefit from data throughput that scales with drive density.",
    "Dual Pivot Technology will use two actuators on separate pivots to double throughput and reduce disk spacing, increasing drive performance and capacity and helping maintain total cost of ownership. As cloud workloads expand, WD's design will offer faster, more efficient data storage than older drives with single read/write streams.",
    "Heat Assisted Magnetic Recording (HAMR) establishes a new technological foundation for recording technology. This advancement renews the progress of increasing areal density, aligning it with future data storage needs over the coming decade and beyond.",
    "Whether you’re trying to reduce your data center’s carbon footprint or storing intellectual property in the race to cure cancer, rely on the Eleven Disk HDD to achieve your goals by optimizing storage density and power efficiency.",
    "UltraSMR enables large-scale deployments, so that massive data centers can power global social media platforms, access vast amounts of legacy financial data, or process extensive and complex genomic data.",
    "ePMR builds on conventional technology so that companies can keep pace with rapidly expanding volumes of data with a proven platform. Confidently store and protect medical records, deliver personalized shopping experiences, or monitor crop yields with ePMR.",
    "When it comes to handling heavy data workloads (think cloud storage services, big data, and AI systems), ArmorCache can help boost productivity by protecting data from power loss and improving performance.",
    "To close the gap between data growth and storage capacity and performance, WD pushed the innovation envelope to create OptiNAND, which integrates a high-speed flash device to create a revolutionary, reimagined storage architecture.",
    "HelioSeal is foundational technology that keeps capacity moving forward— turning possibilities into reality, such as storing and delivering customized movie recommendations to millions and capturing and using data to make cities more energy efficient.",
    "From powering AI to battle climate change to processing ML data to build smart cars, Triple Stage Actuator is a mechanical innovation that integrates with other technologies to enable organizations to ramp up storage capacity and performance.",
    "Imagine a data center as a library, with “hot” items near the door for instant access and “cold” archives way in the back. In between is the vast bulk of the holdings—the books and reference materials that make up the heart of the library, and the “warm” data that forms the core of the data center—all stored on HDDs.",
    "BLOG",
    "At WD, we are delivering the purpose-built data storage solutions that make the entire AI revolution possible.",
    "BLOG",
    "Two WD breakthroughs in HDD technology tackle the problem of access density, the performance constraint that accompanies capacity gains.",
    "BLOG",
    "How HAMR uses laser heating to overcome physical barriers and drive even better HDD economics.",
    "BLOG",
    "WD continues its rich history of innovation, build quality, and engineered durability to boost enterprise HDD reliability and data resilience.",
    "Discover how WD’s pioneering technologies extend beyond hard drives—impacting edge devices, cloud platforms, and everything in between. See how we’re shaping the future of data infrastructure.",
    "Explore advanced storage architectures engineered for demanding data center environments. Our purpose-built HDDs enable scale, performance, and efficiency for mission-critical workloads.",
    "Support massive data growth with our most advanced enterprise HDDs. Built for durability and performance, they’re optimized for hyperscale, cloud, and AI-driven operations.",
    "Experience the future of innovation today!",
